{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>直接在手腕上展開星際戰鬥！Poly Strike 是一款專為 Apple Watch 設計的街機風格太空射擊遊戲。你可以使用數位錶冠精準操控飛船，點擊螢幕發射子彈，擊碎來襲的小行星與敵人。遊戲正處於限時免費期間，原價 US $2.99，現在即可免費下載。</p>\n\n<h2>腕上射擊新體驗</h2>\n<p>遊戲的操控極為直覺，只需轉動數位錶冠即可導航飛船，輕點螢幕便能開火射擊。隨著進度推進，敵人與小行星的波次會越來越密集，而連擊系統讓你能透過連續命中累積高分。此外，遊戲中還可取得護盾、快速射擊與額外生命等強化道具，大幅提升生存能力。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/416x496bb.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/416x496bb-1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/416x496bb-2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/416x496bb-3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/416x496bb-4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/416x496bb-5.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Poly Strike: Watch Space Game</li>\n<li>應用類別：Games</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-10T16:18:29.316357+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}